      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING SAKO (2) was well supported last time and gave a sight after a fast early split but could manage only the minor money, finishing a 2.5 lengths third (35.99) over 622m at Richmond. Likely to feature again. SPEEDY ZIPPER (3) is a consistent dog overall, in the frame at five of 16 starts including seven wins but missed the frame latest when sixth (30.22) over 520m at Wentworth Park. Has a strong record at this journey including two wins. Meets a moderate line up and should run well. DAYS OF WONDER (1) is suited by the inside draw. Last start finished 4th on October 7 over 520m at Nowra behind Skedaddle Benny beaten 12 lengths (30.20) in a Grade 5. Can hit the frame with the right run.",
